  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Wash and dry the fresh produce."
    },
    {
      "text": "Trim and small dice celery. Place in a medium bowl along with mayo, Dijon, and spices. Stir to combine the dressing."
    },
    {
      "text": "Halve and pit avocado; using a spoon, scoop out the flesh and small dice. Add to the bowl with the dressing."
    },
    {
      "text": "Roughly chop eggs. Add to the bowl and stir to combine the egg salad."
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut pita in half and carefully open the pockets. Divide egg salad and sprouts between pockets."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide pita pockets between plates and enjoy!"
    }
